/*
 * Implements creation of lambda delegates from function-pointer values.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - construction of delegate wrappers around function pointers,
 *   - generation of synthetic lambda frames,
 *   - creation of closure variables for fptr-> delegate conversion,
 *   - generation of call expressions forwarding parameters to the fptr,
 *   - insertion of lambda frames into the validation context,
 *   - prevention of duplicate lambda-frame generation via mangling.
 *
 * The conversion from a function pointer to a delegate is implemented as a
 * synthetic lambda whose closure is the function pointer itself. This allows
 * function pointers to be used in any context requiring a delegate value.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::function::lambda::create
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/function/lambda/create.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-25
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
